        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>36 Inch Modern Ladder Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 36 Inch Ladder Door Pull with 24 Inch Center to Centers is a beautiful modern pull done with the today's most popular decorating designs in mind. The sleek, clean lines paired with a contemporary finish, is a great way to update any door. It is available in satin nickel, polished chrome, or oil rubbed bronze finishes. This modern ladder door pull is available with thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting--just make sure to order 2 pulls if you choose to mount your pulls back to back.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis contemporary door handle is made out of <b>3/4\" diameter</b> round tubing--that is the same diameter as a US penny! It has a 24\" center to center mounting (distance between the 2 mounting screws).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-47-specifications.gif?v=1704354599\" width=\"503\" height=\"128\" border=\"0\" alt=\"36 Inch Ladder Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n <a href=\"/products/10-inch-contemporary-pull\"><b>10\" Ladder Pull</b></a>, \r\n <a href=\"/products/12-inch-contemporary-pull\"><b>12\" Ladder Pull</b></a>, and\r\n <a href=\"/products/30-inch-round-ladder-pull-sgs-h3000\"><b>30\" Ladder Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Modern 36\" Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Length: 24\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/4\" Round Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Point Diameter: 27/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2-15/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "36 Inch Ladder Door Pull with 24 Inch Center to Centers, SGS H3600",
                "description": "SGS H3600, 36 Inch Modern Ladder Pull - The 36 Inch Ladder Door Pull with 24 Inch Center to Centers is a beautiful modern pull done with the today's most popular decorating designs in mind. The sleek, clean lines paired with a contemporary finish, is a great way to update any door. It is available in satin nickel, polished chrome, or oil rubbed bronze finishes. This modern ladder door pull is available with thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting--just make sure to order 2 pulls if you choose to mount your pulls back to back.\r\n",
